" This wipes all existing settings. This means that if a setting in this file
" is removed, then it will return to default. In other words, this file serves
" as an enforced single point of truth for Tridactyl's configuration.
sanitize tridactyllocal tridactylsync

" Just use a blank page for new tab. It would be nicer to use the standard
" Firefox homepage, but Tridactyl doesn't support this yet.
set newtab about:blank

" Ctrl-F should use the browser's native 'find' functionality.
unbind <C-f>

" But also support Tridactyl search too.
bind / fillcmdline find
bind ? fillcmdline find -?
bind n findnext 1
bind N findnext -1

" Use sensitive case. Smart case would be nice here, but it doesn't work.
set findcase sensitive

" Smooth scrolling, yes please. This is still a bit janky in Tridactyl.
set smoothscroll true

" The default jump of 10 is a bit much.
bind j scrollline 5
bind k scrollline -5

" One tab per window: every page gets its own window and the window manager
" handles switching. t and w both open a window; the uppercase versions open
" one with the current URL prefilled. w/W match Tridactyl's defaults, but
" they're bound here explicitly so the intent is recorded.
bind t fillcmdline winopen
bind T current_url winopen
bind w fillcmdline winopen
bind W current_url winopen

" Follow a hinted link into a new window.
bind F hint -w

" Plain b only lists tabs in the current window, which is one page here.
" Search pages across all windows instead.
bind b fillcmdline taball

" Escape hatch: Ctrl+T and "Open Link in New Tab" can't be intercepted, so
" detach a stray tab into its own window.
bind gd tabdetach

" Open a window in a container.
bind cpto fillcmdline winopen -c personal
bind cto fillcmdline winopen -c

" Don't run Tridactyl on some web sites because it doesn't work well, or
" because the web site has its own keybindings.
autocmd DocStart mail.google.com mode ignore

" Sometimes the status bar in the bottom left corner overlaps the Tridactyl
" command line, so set an option to move the status bar to the top.
""""" We are commenting these out and adding the changes directly to our
    " custom-chrome so that we use it on nix.

" guiset_quiet hoverlink top
" guiset_quiet menubar default
" " guiset_quiet navbarnonaddonchildren hide
" guiset_quiet padwhenmaximised some
" guiset_quiet tabs none
" guiset_quiet statuspanel left

" Set colorscheme. Using the default theme for now; themes/midday.css is kept
" for later.
colors default

" Add custom search engines
set searchurls.pulls https://github.com/xonasystems/%s/pulls/
set searchurls.repo https://github.com/xonasystems/
set searchurls.actions https://github.com/xonasystems/%s/actions
set searchurls.jira https://xonasystems.atlassian.net/browse/
set searchurls.nixpkgs https://search.nixos.org/packages?channel=unstable&query=%s
